  // five (ops 243/245/247/249/251) need the explicit (pointer float) cast.
  // Same method: a res-lump-data return (v1-108, op 460, the 'visvol lookup
  // for a second actor) grows a running bounding box in place, reading and
  // writing three float pairs at offsets 0/4/8 and 16/20/24 (min then max)
